ation, and no production RAG reindex boundaries.\\n\\n## Artifacts\\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-source-manifest.v1.json\\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-source-manifest.validator-result.json\\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-source-manifest.readback.md\\n\\n## Counts\\n- 3530 real 9709 Question rows represented.\\n- 2672 text-only rows and 858 visual-required rows.\\n- Runtime KG: 13063 nodes, 21932 edges, 3530 postures.\\n- SourceDocumentRegistry: 892 rows, including 460 mark-scheme rows.\\n- Source classifications: 10 canonical_semantic_source, 17 validation_source, 7 auxiliary_context, 6 stale_do_not_consume_directly, 3 blocked_missing.\\n- Explicit gaps: approved syllabus objective taxonomy, approved topic taxonomy, misconception seed evidence.\\n\\n## Verification\\n- npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json\\n- NODE_PATH=/home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-source-manifest.test.js\\n- ESLint via root config/stdin for scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-source-manifest.mjs\\n- ESLint via root config/stdin for scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-source-manifest.test.js\\n- node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-source-manifest.mjs\\n- git diff --cached --check\\n\\nCommit: b6686c9208a4b9b6c099dbda70aca667b5d05c7c\\n","created_at":"2026-07-05T17:38:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T17:43:59Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T17:43:59Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T17:43:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"8e8c98230977e045cb9877b30e05ed7aa5e53a60","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1338/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1338/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.git